flowchart LR
    subgraph Hosted[Hosted SDR runtime - prototype authority compiled]
        Workers[AgentWorker / ReplyWorker<br/>Oban job, before START]
        OfflineGate[SDR.OfflineGate<br/>offline: snooze 60 s, no write, attempt restored]
        Caller[SDR.Model.call/4<br/>agent run, running]
        Facade[AI.ModelProvider facade<br/>reserve then complete]
        Runtime[ModelProvider.Runtime<br/>transport :remote]
        RemoteProv[ClaudeCLI.Remote<br/>availability: worker, intake, heartbeat at most 60 s old<br/>prepare: availability, pins, launch bound]
        WorkerView[Operations.remote_worker_status/1<br/>current binding, agent_runtime actor]
        Reserve[Agents.reserve_model_invocation<br/>CreateRemoteCall + check_request bound]
        Invocation[(ModelInvocation<br/>reserved / sent / terminal)]
        Call[(RemoteModelCall<br/>pending / claimed / completed / expired)]
        Wait[Bounded wait<br/>no tx, lock or connection; monotonic; poll + audit event]
        Gate[ResultGate.gate<br/>release-gated read only]
        Intake[WorkerIntake plug<br/>POST, JSON object, 13 MiB cap]
        Controller[WorkerController<br/>bearer token; fixed error codes]
        RemoteCalls[Agents.RemoteCalls<br/>heartbeat / claim / complete under locks]
        Result[(RemoteCallResult<br/>immutable transcript)]
        Settler[RemoteSettler Oban cron<br/>settle_due: kernel + :remote_settler marker]
        Finish[Agents finish actions<br/>complete / fail / mark_unknown]
        Run[(AgentRun budget<br/>BudgetCounter: running only)]
        Ledger[(Audit ledger)]
        Release[(ModelResultRelease)]
    end

    subgraph Mac[Owner Mac - ordinary standalone VM]
        MacAgent[mix sdr.mac_agent<br/>outbound HTTPS only]
        CLI[Pinned claude CLI<br/>one launch per claimed call]
    end

    Local[Local transport only:<br/>ProfileSupervisor, server, reaper, shim]

    Workers -- resolved Remote, run queued; AgentWorker also Operation enqueued --> OfflineGate
    OfflineGate -- availability/1, lock-free read --> RemoteProv
    OfflineGate -. available: START .-> Caller
    Caller --> Facade
    Facade --> Runtime
    Runtime -- resolve: Remote, no local server --> RemoteProv
    Runtime -. status/0 observational .-> WorkerView
    RemoteProv --> WorkerView
    Facade -- prepare ok --> Reserve
    Reserve --> Invocation
    Reserve --> Call
    Facade -- :remote_dispatched only from ClaudeCLI.Remote --> Wait
    Wait -- completed --> Gate
    Gate -- released read --> Caller
    Gate --> Release
    Wait -- timeout: run fails remote_wait_timeout --> Run

    MacAgent -- heartbeat / claim / complete --> Intake
    Intake --> Controller
    Controller --> RemoteCalls
    RemoteCalls -- claim: launch bytes or call null --> Controller
    Controller -- launch --> MacAgent
    MacAgent --> CLI
    CLI -- stream-json transcript --> MacAgent
    RemoteCalls --> Call
    RemoteCalls -- complete --> Result

    Settler --> RemoteCalls
    RemoteCalls -- expire / settle from stored transcript --> Finish
    Finish --> Invocation
    Finish -- running run: settle_model_call --> Run
    Finish -. terminal run: ledger-only under private settler capability .-> Invocation
    Finish --> Ledger
    Invocation -- audit event wakes --> Wait

    Runtime -. transport :local only .-> Local

    %% Production build without prototype authority: prepare refuses provider_not_running,
    %% worker view absent, no settler, no terminal-settle clause.
    %% S-B6: a disconnect inside the 60 s freshness window still reserves (charged); a worker going
    %% stale between gate and prepare is refused provider_offline before reservation. Gate is never admission.
    %% Late results are recorded but never released into or resume a terminal run.
